    "faq": {
      "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "description": "Find answers to the most common questions about shopping, shipping, returns, and more.",
      "heroDescription": "Find answers to the most common questions about our products and services.",
      "q1": "How do I place an order?",
      "a1": "To place an order, simply browse our catalog, add the products you want to your cart, and follow the checkout process. You'll need to create an account or sign in to complete the order. Once placed, you'll receive a confirmation email with the details.",
      "q2": "What payment methods do you accept?",
      "a2": "We accept credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), PayPal, and bank transfers. All payments are securely processed through Stripe, ensuring your financial data is protected.",
      "q3": "How long does shipping take?",
      "a3": "Delivery times vary depending on your location. For domestic shipping (mainland Spain), estimated delivery is 2-4 business days. For Balearic Islands, Canary Islands, and international orders, it may take 5-10 business days. All shipments include a tracking number.",
      "q4": "What is your return policy?",
      "a4": "We accept returns within 14 calendar days of receiving your order. Products must be in their original condition, unused, and in their original packaging. To initiate a return, contact our customer service team.",
      "q5": "Do you provide VAT invoices?",
      "a5": "Yes, all our invoices include the applicable VAT. When placing your order, you can enter your Tax ID and billing details, and we'll send the electronic invoice to your email once payment is confirmed.",
      "q6": "How can I contact support?",
      "a6": "You can reach us through our contact form at /contact, by emailing info@mystore.com, or by calling +34 900 123 456 during business hours (Mon-Fri 9:00-18:00, Sat 10:00-14:00).",
